u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&amp;a=w%3D422%26h%3D435%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 422w,/_gatsby/image/96c5c437cdb63967b541532aa641ca40/a26906483676c5ecc5a8509bf76fd4b0/super-awesome.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&amp;a=w%3D843%26h%3D868%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 843w\" alt=\"\"/></noscript><script type=\"module\">const t=\"undefined\"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&\"loading\"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll(\"img[data-main-image]\");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute(\"src\",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute(\"data-src\")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute(\"srcset\",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute(\"data-srcset\"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll(\"source[data-srcset]\");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute(\"srcset\",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute(\"data-srcset\");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector(\"[data-placeholder-image]\").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><script type=\"application/json\" data-wp-inline-image-hydration=\"1\">{\"image\":{\"images\":{\"sources\":[],\"fallback\":{\"src\":\"/_gatsby/image/96c5c437cdb63967b541532aa641ca40/f671d93c6d2d366c4aac8654a449f69b/super-awesome.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&a=w%3D211%26h%3D217%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90\",\"srcSet\":\"/_gatsby/image/96c5c437cdb63967b541532aa641ca40/f671d93c6d2d366c4aac8654a449f69b/super-awesome.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&a=w%3D211%26h%3D217%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 211w,/_gatsby/image/96c5c437cdb63967b541532aa641ca40/f0946feed36daa9fc1cc75e09fa5f62d/super-awesome.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&a=w%3D422%26h%3D435%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 422w,/_gatsby/image/96c5c437cdb63967b541532aa641ca40/a26906483676c5ecc5a8509bf76fd4b0/super-awesome.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fsuper-awesome.png&a=w%3D843%26h%3D868%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 843w\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 843px) 843px, 100vw\"}},\"layout\":\"constrained\",\"width\":843,\"height\":868},\"alt\":\"\",\"className\":\"wp-image-311 inline-gatsby-image-wrapper\",\"data-wp-inline-image\":\"1\"}</script></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>What do you use landing pages for?</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p>And as the title suggests, this is the first page that your customers should visit on your website. Ensure you know what you’re trying to achieve from your landing page, as this will impact how you subsequently create the page. Are you trying to:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul><li>Sell a product? Then this is where Google / Facebook / Instagram / TikTok ad should be pointed at.</li><li>Capture marketing leads or signups?</li><li>Launch a marketing campaign?</li><li>Simply develop an amazing homepage?</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://blog.hubspot.com/hs-fs/hubfs/W0bznvUUV3.gif?width=690&amp;name=W0bznvUUV3.gif\" alt=\"\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3><strong>Sections of a landing page:</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<ol type=\"1\"><li>Hero section. You want an attention grabbing headline (eg what problem do you solve?) and an image above the fold. This section is crucial as most people won’t scroll down your page!</li><li>Explanation. What is the product? Who is this product for? Why should I buy it? (you need to display the key benefits) Why is this product better than the competition? (Us vs Them section works well here)</li><li>Social Proof. Provide customer reviews of your product.</li><li>Build Trust. Give the viewers evidence of safe checkout on your website or guarantees of returns and refunds policies. You could also add verified reviews of your product here.</li><li>FAQs. Collect any feedback on your product or service into this section. Definitely include your delivery and returns information here.</li><li>CTA. Send the customer to buy the product!</li></ol>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Other things to consider:</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul type=\"1\"><li>What colours are you using on the landing page? Different colours can have different impacts. For example, blue installs trust, while green stimulated harmony. Ensure your CTA stands out from the background? </li></ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><div data-gatsby-image-wrapper=\"\" style=\"position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top\" class=\"gatsby-image-wrapper gatsby-image-wrapper-constrained wp-image-315 inline-gatsby-image-wrapper\" data-reactroot=\"\"><div style=\"max-width:843px;display:block\"><img alt=\"\" role=\"presentation\" aria-hidden=\"true\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg height=&#x27;421&#x27; width=&#x27;843&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27; version=&#x27;1.1&#x27;%3E%3C/svg%3E\" style=\"max-width:100%;display:block;position:static\"/></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" data-placeholder-image=\"\" style=\"height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;top:0;width:100%\"></div><img data-gatsby-image-ssr=\"\" data-wp-inline-image=\"2\" data-main-image=\"\" style=\"height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;top:0;transform:translateZ(0);transition:opacity 250ms linear;width:100%;will-change:opacity;opacity:0\" sizes=\"(min-width: 843px) 843px, 100vw\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90\" data-srcset=\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 211w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/3a4d9acd5c4c3920cc582234ff3ca1d4/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D422%26h%3D211%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 422w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/ee47b6adc668ab4399e125d9345288bb/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D843%26h%3D421%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 843w\" alt=\"\"/><noscript><img data-gatsby-image-ssr=\"\" data-wp-inline-image=\"2\" data-main-image=\"\" style=\"height:100%;left:0;position:absolute;top:0;transform:translateZ(0);transition:opacity 250ms linear;width:100%;will-change:opacity;opacity:0\" sizes=\"(min-width: 843px) 843px, 100vw\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90\" srcSet=\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 211w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/3a4d9acd5c4c3920cc582234ff3ca1d4/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D422%26h%3D211%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 422w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/ee47b6adc668ab4399e125d9345288bb/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&amp;a=w%3D843%26h%3D421%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 843w\" alt=\"\"/></noscript><script type=\"module\">const t=\"undefined\"!=typeof HTMLImageElement&&\"loading\"in HTMLImageElement.prototype;if(t){const t=document.querySelectorAll(\"img[data-main-image]\");for(let e of t){e.dataset.src&&(e.setAttribute(\"src\",e.dataset.src),e.removeAttribute(\"data-src\")),e.dataset.srcset&&(e.setAttribute(\"srcset\",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute(\"data-srcset\"));const t=e.parentNode.querySelectorAll(\"source[data-srcset]\");for(let e of t)e.setAttribute(\"srcset\",e.dataset.srcset),e.removeAttribute(\"data-srcset\");e.complete&&(e.style.opacity=1,e.parentNode.parentNode.querySelector(\"[data-placeholder-image]\").style.opacity=0)}}</script></div><script type=\"application/json\" data-wp-inline-image-hydration=\"2\">{\"image\":{\"images\":{\"sources\":[],\"fallback\":{\"src\":\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90\",\"srcSet\":\"/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/6b8956aa82e1b8257c79ddbe05508dc1/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&a=w%3D211%26h%3D105%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 211w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/3a4d9acd5c4c3920cc582234ff3ca1d4/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&a=w%3D422%26h%3D211%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 422w,/_gatsby/image/c339029065f2dc20046cb2155833d114/ee47b6adc668ab4399e125d9345288bb/spotify.png?u=https%3A%2F%2Fstory-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2Fspotify.png&a=w%3D843%26h%3D421%26fm%3Dpng%26q%3D90 843w\",\"sizes\":\"(min-width: 843px) 843px, 100vw\"}},\"layout\":\"constrained\",\"width\":843,\"height\":421},\"alt\":\"\",\"className\":\"wp-image-315 inline-gatsby-image-wrapper\",\"data-wp-inline-image\":\"2\"}</script></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul type=\"1\"><li>Have Google Analytics installed on your site to measure the traffic to your landing page. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/1638635?hl=en#zippy=%2Cin-this-article\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Realtime conversion reports</a> enable you to see the live activities on your landing page. <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6086209?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Conversions overview</a> will show you data on goal completions and completion rates. The <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/1191180?hl=en#zippy=%2Cin-this-article\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Multi-channel conversion visualiser</a> will also display the paths of where your conversions came from.</li><li>Try Google Optimise to A/B test your landing page. Alter your copy, colours and CTA and see if it increases conversions.</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Good luck with your landing page! ✊</h3>\n","dateGmt":"2022-05-20T12:10:58"},"seoPage":{"nodeType":"Post","title":"How to create a brilliant landing page!","uri":"/2022/05/20/how-to-create-a-brilliant-landing-page/","seo":{"title":"How to create a brilliant landing page! - My Blog","metaDesc":"","focuskw":"","metaKeywords":"","metaRobotsNoindex":"index","metaRobotsNofollow":"follow","opengraphTitle":"How to create a brilliant landing page! - My Blog","opengraphDescription":"Landing pages are a crucial element to selling your product or service. They offer far more than just the all the information on your product pages. They also offer the opportunity for a quicker loading and less cluttered page – as you can remove a lot of the standard content which appears across the rest […]","opengraphImage":{"altText":"","sourceUrl":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/in-case-you-missed-it_moon-landing_1600x775-thumb.png","srcSet":"https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/in-case-you-missed-it_moon-landing_1600x775-thumb.png 300w, https://story-spinner-vvj7.temp-dns.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/in-case-you-missed-it_moon-landing_1600x775-thumb-150x150.png 150w"},"twitterTitl